****
This helium line is much weaker than the yellow helium. It hides in a barcode of spectral lines, on the disk, though readily shows prominences off limb.
With heavy processing, some filaments may be revealed, but the gist of the yellow helium isn't really there. 
I've not seen flares in this wavelength so far. Light blankets above the active regions, at the disk edge, are there just like with other helium lines.